    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jesse Pavey",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109887367107530258977/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKIlDTGWhaGz6C8LowE7fLjfMetp0aUk5GrXn1R7xbZZTR_xg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I recently had the opportunity to visit Dr. Flipo for shoulder pain that had been bothering me for months. From the moment I walked into the clinic, I felt welcomed and at ease. Dr. Flipo took the time to thoroughly assess my condition, explaining each step of the process and addressing all my concerns.\n\nMy girlfriend recommended him, and I truly don’t understand why he’s not charging more! After just a few sessions, I noticed a significant reduction in pain and an improved range of motion. His techniques are effective, and he genuinely cares about his patients' well-being. I appreciate his holistic approach and the personalized care I received.\n\nI highly recommend Dr. Flipo to anyone dealing with similar issues. Thanks to him, I’m back to my normal activities pain-free!",
        "time": 1725942611,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jean Christophe",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111877759638414558494/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXhMWYhSiPkFBaI79YLJVIMaKZ3q-_ro3H8VtyyxDv_bTP-TRcx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Great chiropractor with many years of experience he is Very professional, he take his time and always give you 120% of his attention.\nDr Flipo have almost 40 yrs of experiences he is caring, knowledgeable, thoughtful and professional.\nHe work in 2 clinics take if necessary and reviews the X-rays with you to understand your problem.\nI recommend the clinic to all the people and my family.\n5 stars or more all the way",
        "time": 1713446632,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Hannah",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106543220271750606825/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIn_rXhlYBNyh6wgx_ZLU7sZsWPItmmu1j4kuvowQ1AkaF4zQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Dr. Flipo is truly unmatched in the realm of chiropractic care! For years now, I've been making the journey from Montreal to L'Île-Perrot just to see him, and every visit reaffirms why I continue to do so. His expertise goes beyond mere adjustments; he has an uncanny ability to understand the intricacies of both my mental and physical health.\nDr. Flipo's impact on my well-being has been profound. His approach has not only alleviated physical discomfort but has also brought about a remarkable improvement in my overall mindset. I've struggled to find another practitioner who can match his level of dedication and effectiveness.\nIf you're seeking a chiropractor who genuinely cares and can work wonders, look no further than Dr. Flipo. Trust me, the drive is more than worth it for the transformative experience he provides!",
        "time": 1714498128,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Advertising Cda",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112258409591940792003/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVMMfv6n2nWmIWk7SbwVMzflp9QgWQkAehC5oSAHIl3f9UdksBt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I have been receiving treatment from Dr. Flippo for over 20 years. Knowledgeable, kind and treats every client as a close family friend. I highly recommend him if you are seeking the best of the best!",
        "time": 1721333489,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Richard Chambers",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103619104551450203924/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocILtPjZ-EPxDq6pTGpmnjZZwn3E47Dal3ek1iCDiGrI1Cq4dQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Dr. Flipo has the singular ability to feel the misalignment of the body's normal state and readjust to an optimum level. He is professional , dedicated and caring. He never rushes you through a session but rather takes the time needed to bring one back on the path to wellness. Dr. Filpo and his staff have maintained my highest appreciation .",
